      "message": "The current behavior is intended, to match the Canvas2D spec.\nThe comment describing the mode\u0027s behavior was originally longer, and correct.\nIt was changed to a shorter, incorrect description at a later point.\n\nI added a more detailed comment to the Skia issue about this.\nThe original commit, discussing the indended behavior, is\nhttps://codereview.chromium.org/151353006#msg19\n\nI think that the current behavior is correct, and the comment should be changed,\nrather than the other way around.  Note that the current behavior does not extend\na closed contour, it creates a new contour starting at the start point of the old contour, and extends that with the added contour.",
